{"out": "../../../output/cant-let-go-draft/part7.mp4", "audio": "p7.wav", "speed": 1.0, "tail": 2.0, "music_fade": 2.0, "music_cues": [{"shot": 0, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/fifth-of-february.mp3", "start": 10.0}, {"shot": 5, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/unforgiven.mp3", "start": 40.0}, {"shot": 11, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/fifth-of-february.mp3"}], "music_volume": 0.33, "fade_out": 2.0, "style": {"grade": "night", "captions": "underline", "caption_y": 0.86, "vignette": 0.5, "grain": 4}, "shots": [{"text": "And the last thing, the one that actually set me free.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["THE ONE THAT", "white"], ["SET ME FREE", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0, "@set"]}, "sfx": [{"name": "boom", "at": "@free", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Fill the space they left with your own life.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-empty-room.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "Not with a new person straight away. With yourself.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["NOT A NEW PERSON.", "white"], ["YOURSELF.", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0, "@yourself"]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Your friends, your goals, the hobbies you dropped when you were busy waiting for a reply.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-full-room.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.3, "drift": 0}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "Because the real reason someone takes over your mind is that there's too much empty room in it.", "v": {"mg": "versus", "left": ["EMPTY ROOM", "THEY MOVE IN"], "right": ["FULL LIFE", "NO ROOM LEFT"], "at": "@empty", "left_at": 0.0}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "For me it was running.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/running-0.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "pause_before": 0.3, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "I started because I couldn't sleep, and I needed to be tired.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-run-night.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0, "drift": 0.07}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "Three months later, I signed up for my first half marathon.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/marathon-1.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "overlays": [{"mg": "tag", "text": "HALF MARATHON  13.1 MI", "at": "@half", "pos": [0.04, 0.08]}], "in": "zoom", "sfx": [{"name": "sweep", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "Somewhere around mile nine,", "v": {"video": "../../stock/running-5.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "overlays": [{"mg": "tag", "text": "MILE 9", "at": 0.1, "pos": [0.04, 0.08]}], "in": "cut"}, {"text": "I realised I hadn't thought about Lena all day. Not once.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-finish.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.3, "drift": 0}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "I wasn't trying not to. There just wasn't room anymore.", "v": {"mg": "marker", "lines": ["THERE WASN'T", "ROOM ANYMORE"], "mark": ["ROOM ANYMORE"], "times": [0.0, "@room"]}, "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "sparkle", "at": "@anymore"}], "in": "spin", "captions": false}, {"text": "And here's the thing nobody tells you about getting over someone.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/sunrise-4.mp4", "start": 6.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "pause_before": 0.25, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "You don't wake up one day and decide it's over.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-sleep.jpg", "focus": [0.45, 0.45], "zoom": 1.1}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "You just notice, one random Tuesday, that they weren't the first thing you thought about this morning.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-tuesday.jpg", "focus": [0.4, 0.4], "zoom": 1.0, "drift": 0.06}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "And then it's a week.", "v": {"mg": "timer", "seconds": 10080, "label": "ONE WEEK", "end_label": "FREE"}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "tick", "at": 0.2}, {"name": "tick", "at": 0.55}, {"name": "tick", "at": 0.8999999999999999}, {"name": "tick", "at": 1.2499999999999998}], "captions": false}, {"text": "And then you hear that song in the supermarket, and you smile, and you keep walking.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-smile-walk.jpg", "focus": [0.45, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.3, "drift": 0}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "That smile is how you know.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/supermarket-5.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "zoom", "sfx": [{"name": "sweep", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "Not that you forgot them.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["NOT THAT YOU", "white"], ["FORGOT THEM.", "white"]], "times": [0.0, "@forgot"]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "That they finally became a memory instead of a wound.", "v": {"mg": "versus", "left": ["NOT A", "WOUND"], "right": ["A", "MEMORY"], "at": "@memory", "left_at": 0.0}, "sfx": [{"name": "reveal", "at": "@memory"}], "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "So if you're lying awake tonight thinking about someone, be gentle with yourself.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-2am.jpg", "focus": [0.45, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0}, "pause_before": 0.3, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "Your brain isn't broken. It's healing.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["NOT BROKEN.", "white"], ["HEALING.", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0, "@healing"]}, "in": "spin", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Close the loop.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "HOW TO LET GO", "items": ["CLOSE THE LOOP", "STOP FEEDING THE CRAVING", "LET THE THOUGHTS PASS", "BUILD A FULL LIFE"], "times": [0.05, 999, 999, 999]}, "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": 0.05}], "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "Stop feeding the craving.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "HOW TO LET GO", "items": ["CLOSE THE LOOP", "STOP FEEDING THE CRAVING", "LET THE THOUGHTS PASS", "BUILD A FULL LIFE"], "times": [-1, 0.05, 999, 999]}, "in": "cut", "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": 0.05}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Let the thoughts pass.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "HOW TO LET GO", "items": ["CLOSE THE LOOP", "STOP FEEDING THE CRAVING", "LET THE THOUGHTS PASS", "BUILD A FULL LIFE"], "times": [-1, -1, 0.05, 999]}, "in": "cut", "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": 0.05}], "captions": false}, {"text": "And build a life so full that one day, there's simply no room left for someone who chose not to stay.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "HOW TO LET GO", "items": ["CLOSE THE LOOP", "STOP FEEDING THE CRAVING", "LET THE THOUGHTS PASS", "BUILD A FULL LIFE"], "times": [-1, -1, -1, 0.05]}, "in": "cut", "sfx": [{"name": "sparkle", "at": 0.05}], "captions": false}, {"text": "If this helped you, send it to someone who's been stuck on someone for way too long.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["SEND THIS TO SOMEONE", "white"], ["WHO CAN'T LET GO", "yellow"]], "times": ["@send", "@stuck"]}, "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": "@send"}, {"name": "pop", "at": "@stuck"}], "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "They need to hear that they're not crazy. And I'll see you in the next one.", "v": {"img": "../../img/c-smile-walk.jpg", "focus": [0.45, 0.45], "zoom": 1.2, "drift": -0.12}, "in": "blur", "sfx": [{"name": "tunnel", "gain": 0.5}]}]}